content:
Perfect — here's a complete, self-contained single-page site. Minimalist, blue/red accents, everything inline (no external fonts or scripts), so it'll work as-is on GitHub Pages.

Copy this into a file named **`index.html`**, drop it in a repo, and enable Pages (steps at the bottom). I've marked every spot you'll want to personalize with `<!-- EDIT -->` comments.

```html
<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
<title>LT 2010 — Computer Skills for the Information Age</title>
<style>
  :root {
    --blue: #1d4ed8;
    --blue-dark: #1e3a8a;
    --red: #dc2626;
    --ink: #18181b;
    --muted: #6b7280;
    --line: #e5e7eb;
    --bg: #ffffff;
    --bg-soft: #fafafa;
    --maxw: 860px;
  }
  * { box-sizing: border-box; }
  html { scroll-behavior: smooth; }
  body {
    margin: 0;
    font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, "Segoe UI", Roboto, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;
    color: var(--ink);
    background: var(--bg);
    line-height: 1.65;
    font-size: 17px;
    -webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased;
  }
  a { color: var(--blue); text-decoration: none; }
  a:hover { text-decoration: underline; }

  /* Nav */
  nav {
    position: sticky; top: 0; z-index: 10;
    background: rgba(255,255,255,0.85);
    backdrop-filter: saturate(180%) blur(10px);
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--line);
  }
  .nav-inner {
    max-width: var(--maxw); margin: 0 auto;
    padding: 14px 24px;
    display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: space-between;
    flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 8px;
  }
  .brand { font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: -0.01em; font-size: 15px; }
  .brand .code { color: var(--red); }
  .nav-links { display: flex; gap: 22px; font-size: 14px; }
  .nav-links a { color: var(--muted); }
  .nav-links a:hover { color: var(--ink); text-decoration: none; }

  /* Layout */
  section { max-width: var(--maxw); margin: 0 auto; padding: 64px 24px; }
  section + section { border-top: 1px solid var(--line); }
  h1, h2, h3 { letter-spacing: -0.02em; line-height: 1.2; }
  h2 {
    font-size: 14px; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.08em;
    color: var(--blue); margin: 0 0 24px; font-weight: 700;
  }

  /* Hero */
  .hero { padding-top: 88px; padding-bottom: 72px; }
  .eyebrow {
    display: inline-block; font-size: 13px; font-weight: 600;
    color: var(--red); letter-spacing: 0.06em; text-transform: uppercase;
    margin-bottom: 18px;
  }
  .hero h1 { font-size: 44px; margin: 0 0 20px; font-weight: 800; }
  .hero p.lede { font-size: 20px; color: var(--muted); max-width: 640px; margin: 0; }
  .accent-bar {
    width: 64px; height: 4px; margin-top: 28px;
    background: linear-gradient(90deg, var(--blue), var(--red));
    border-radius: 2px;
  }

  /* Overview text */
  .prose p { margin: 0 0 18px; }
  .prose p:last-child { margin-bottom: 0; }

  /* Goals */
  .goals { list-style: none; padding: 0; margin: 0; display: grid; gap: 4px; }
  .goals li {
    padding: 16px 0; border-bottom: 1px solid var(--line);
    display: flex; gap: 16px; align-items: baseline;
  }
  .goals li:last-child { border-bottom: none; }
  .goals .num {
    color: var(--blue); font-weight: 700; font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums;
    min-width: 24px;
  }

  /* Schedule table */
  .table-wrap { overflow-x: auto; -webkit-overflow-scrolling: touch; }
  table { width: 100%; border-collapse: collapse; font-size: 15px; min-width: 560px; }
  thead th {
    text-align: left; font-size: 12px; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.06em;
    color: var(--muted); font-weight: 600; padding: 0 16px 12px 0; border-bottom: 2px solid var(--ink);
  }
  tbody td { padding: 16px 16px 16px 0; border-bottom: 1px solid var(--line); vertical-align: top; }
  tbody tr:hover { background: var(--bg-soft); }
  td.topic { font-weight: 600; }
  td.date { white-space: nowrap; color: var(--muted); font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums; }
  .tag {
    display: inline-block; font-size: 12px; font-weight: 600; padding: 2px 8px;
    border-radius: 999px; margin: 2px 4px 2px 0; white-space: nowrap;
  }
  .tag.disc { background: #eff6ff; color: var(--blue-dark); }
  .tag.assign { background: #fef2f2; color: var(--red); }
  .tag.extra { background: #f4f4f5; color: var(--muted); }
  .star { color: var(--red); font-weight: 700; }
  .break-row td {
    text-align: center; font-style: italic; color: var(--muted);
    background: var(--bg-soft); font-size: 14px;
  }
  .note {
    font-size: 14px; color: var(--muted); margin-top: 18px;
    display: flex; gap: 8px; align-items: baseline;
  }

  /* Assignments */
  .cards { display: grid; gap: 16px; grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr); }
  .card {
    border: 1px solid var(--line); border-radius: 12px; padding: 20px;
    border-top: 3px solid var(--red);
  }
  .card h3 { margin: 0 0 6px; font-size: 17px; }
  .card .due { font-size: 13px; color: var(--muted); font-weight: 600; }
  .card p { margin: 10px 0 0; font-size: 14px; color: var(--muted); }

  /* Info / contact */
  .info-grid { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr; gap: 32px; }
  .info-grid dt { font-size: 12px; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.06em; color: var(--muted); }
  .info-grid dd { margin: 4px 0 20px; }

  footer {
    max-width: var(--maxw); margin: 0 auto; padding: 40px 24px 64px;
    border-top: 1px solid var(--line); color: var(--muted); font-size: 14px;
  }

  @media (max-width: 640px) {
    .hero h1 { font-size: 34px; }
    .hero p.lede { font-size: 18px; }
    section { padding: 48px 20px; }
    .cards { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
    .info-grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr; gap: 0; }
    .nav-links { display: none; }
  }
</style>
</head>
<body>

<nav>
  <div class="nav-inner">
    <div class="brand"><span class="code">LT 2010</span> · Computer Skills for the Information Age</div>
    <div class="nav-links">
      <a href="#overview">Overview</a>
      <a href="#goals">Goals</a>
      <a href="#schedule">Schedule</a>
      <a href="#assignments">Assignments</a>
      <a href="#info">Info</a>
    </div>
  </div>
</nav>

<header class="hero">
  <section style="padding-top:0;padding-bottom:0;border:none;">
    <span class="eyebrow">Department of Learning Sciences <!-- EDIT: dept/university --></span>
    <h1>Computer Skills for the Information Age</h1>
    <p class="lede">Becoming a thoughtful, capable, and ethical participant in a digital and AI-saturated world.</p>
    <div class="accent-bar"></div>
  </section>
</header>

<section id="overview">
  <h2>Overview</h2>
  <div class="prose">
    <p>Computing, technology, and artificial intelligence now shape how we learn, work, communicate, and make decisions. This course helps you become a thoughtful, capable, and ethical participant in a digital and AI-saturated world.</p>
    <p>Over the semester we cover a range of topics: how to use computing as a tool to work and create with data; how to learn effectively (with and without AI); how to find and judge digital information; how to reason about the ethics of technology; and how to build a professional digital presence for your career.</p>
    <p>This course is designed for students from a variety of backgrounds. <strong>No prerequisites are required.</strong></p>
  </div>
</section>

<section id="goals">
  <h2>What you'll learn</h2>
  <ul class="goals">
    <li><span class="num">01</span><span>Use computing as a tool to work and create with data.</span></li>
    <li><span class="num">02</span><span>Learn effectively — with and without AI.</span></li>
    <li><span class="num">03</span><span>Find, evaluate, and judge digital information.</span></li>
    <li><span class="num">04</span><span>Reason about the ethics, privacy, and power dynamics of technology.</span></li>
    <li><span class="num">05</span><span>Create a professional digital presence for your career.</span></li>
  </ul>
</section>

<section id="schedule">
  <h2>Schedule</h2>
  <div class="table-wrap">
    <table>
      <thead>
        <tr>
          <th>Topic</th>
          <th>Assignments &amp; Discussions</th>
          <th>Due</th>
        </tr>
      </thead>
      <tbody>
        <tr>
          <td class="topic">Learning in a Digital &amp; AI Age</td>
          <td><span class="tag disc">Week 1 Discussion</span><span class="tag extra">AI/digital tool survey</span></td>
          <td class="date">Jan 17</td>
        </tr>
        <tr>
          <td class="topic">Learning How to Learn</td>
          <td><span class="tag disc">Week 2 Discussion</span></td>
          <td class="date">Jan 24</td>
        </tr>
        <tr>
          <td class="topic">Digital Communication &amp; Collaboration</td>
          <td><span class="tag disc">Week 3 Discussion</span></td>
          <td class="date">Jan 31</td>
        </tr>
        <tr>
          <td class="topic">Information Literacy</td>
          <td><span class="tag disc">Week 4 Discussion</span><span class="tag assign">Assignment 1</span></td>
          <td class="date">Feb 7</td>
        </tr>
        <tr>
          <td class="topic">AI Literacy</td>
          <td><span class="tag disc">Week 5 Discussion</span></td>
          <td class="date">Feb 14</td>
        </tr>
        <tr>
          <td class="topic">Ethics, Privacy &amp; Power in an AI Age</td>
          <td><span class="tag disc">Week 6 Discussion</span></td>
          <td class="date">Feb 21</td>
        </tr>
        <tr>
          <td class="topic">Human-Centered Design</td>
          <td><span class="tag disc">Week 7 Discussion</span></td>
          <td class="date">Feb 28</td>
        </tr>
        <tr>
          <td class="topic">Professional Identity &amp; Self-Presentation</td>
          <td><span class="tag disc">Week 8 Discussion</span><span class="tag assign">Assignment 2</span></td>
          <td class="date">Mar 7</td>
        </tr>
        <tr>
          <td class="topic">Working with Data</td>
          <td><span class="tag disc">Week 9 Discussion</span></td>
          <td class="date">Mar 14</td>
        </tr>
        <tr class="break-row">
          <td colspan="3">Fall / Spring Break</td>
        </tr>
        <tr>
          <td class="topic">Data Storytelling &amp; Visualization <span class="star" title="Two weeks to complete">**</span></td>
          <td><span class="tag disc">Week 10 Discussion</span></td>
          <td class="date">Apr 4</td>
        </tr>
        <tr>
          <td class="topic">Coding &amp; Computational Thinking <span class="star" title="Two weeks to complete">**</span></td>
          <td><span class="tag disc">Week 11 Discussion</span></td>
          <td class="date">Apr 19</td>
        </tr>
        <tr>
          <td class="topic">Final Assignment</td>
          <td><span class="tag assign">Assignment 3</span></td>
          <td class="date">Apr 26</td>
        </tr>
      </tbody>
    </table>
  </div>
  <p class="note"><span class="star">**</span><span>You have two weeks to complete this unit, giving you time to work on your final assignment. Topics and readings are subject to change — always check this schedule for the latest.</span></p>
</section>

<section id="assignments">
  <h2>Major Assignments</h2>
  <div class="cards">
    <div class="card">
      <div class="due">Due Feb 7</div>
      <h3>Assignment 1</h3>
      <p><!-- EDIT: short description -->Information literacy in practice.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="card">
      <div class="due">Due Mar 7</div>
      <h3>Assignment 2</h3>
      <p><!-- EDIT: short description -->Building your professional digital identity.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="card">
      <div class="due">Due Apr 26</div>
      <h3>Assignment 3 · Final</h3>
      <p><!-- EDIT: short description -->A capstone project bringing the course together.</p>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section id="info">
  <h2>Course Info</h2>
  <dl class="info-grid">
    <div>
      <dt>Instructor</dt>
      <dd>Your Name <!-- EDIT --></dd>
      <dt>Email</dt>
      <dd><a href="mailto:you@university.edu">you@university.edu</a> <!-- EDIT --></dd>
    </div>
    <div>
      <dt>Office Hours</dt>
      <dd>Day / time / location <!-- EDIT --></dd>
      <dt>Prerequisites</dt>
      <dd>None</dd>
    </div>
  </dl>
</section>

<footer>
  LT 2010 · Computer Skills for the Information Age — Department of Learning Sciences <!-- EDIT -->.
  Spring 2026. Schedule subject to change.
</footer>

</body>
</html>
```

---

**Design notes**
- Minimalist: system fonts, generous whitespace, thin rules, no clutter. The only color is your blue/red — used as a gradient accent bar, tab-style tags (blue = discussions, red = assignments), and card top-borders.
- The schedule scrolls horizontally on phones so it never breaks the layout; the `**` two-week units are flagged in red with a hover tooltip.
- Sticky blurred nav for quick jumps.

**To publish on GitHub Pages**
1. Create a repo (e.g. `lt2010`), add this file as `index.html`.
2. Repo **Settings → Pages → Source: Deploy from a branch → `main` / `root`**.
3. Your site goes live at `https://<username>.github.io/lt2010/` in ~1 minute.

Want me to adjust anything — fill in real assignment descriptions, add a grading breakdown or readings column, tweak the palette to your exact university hex codes, or add a dark mode?

Good call — bigger headings give it more presence, and some light geometric imagery suits the digital/AI theme without breaking the minimalism. I've kept everything **inline SVG** (no external image files) so it stays fully self-contained for GitHub.

Here's the updated `index.html`:

```html
<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
<title>LT 2010 — Computer Skills for the Information Age</title>
<style>
  :root {
    --blue: #1d4ed8;
    --blue-dark: #1e3a8a;
    --red: #dc2626;
    --ink: #18181b;
    --muted: #6b7280;
    --line: #e5e7eb;
    --bg: #ffffff;
    --bg-soft: #fafafa;
    --maxw: 900px;
  }
  * { box-sizing: border-box; }
  html { scroll-behavior: smooth; }
  body {
    margin: 0;
    font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, "Segoe UI", Roboto, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;
    color: var(--ink);
    background: var(--bg);
    line-height: 1.65;
    font-size: 17px;
    -webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased;
  }
  a { color: var(--blue); text-decoration: none; }
  a:hover { text-decoration: underline; }

  /* Nav */
  nav {
    position: sticky; top: 0; z-index: 10;
    background: rgba(255,255,255,0.85);
    backdrop-filter: saturate(180%) blur(10px);
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--line);
  }
  .nav-inner {
    max-width: var(--maxw); margin: 0 auto;
    padding: 14px 24px;
    display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: space-between;
    flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 8px;
  }
  .brand { font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: -0.01em; font-size: 15px; }
  .brand .code { color: var(--red); }
  .nav-links { display: flex; gap: 22px; font-size: 14px; }
  .nav-links a { color: var(--muted); }
  .nav-links a:hover { color: var(--ink); text-decoration: none; }

  /* Layout */
  section { max-width: var(--maxw); margin: 0 auto; padding: 72px 24px; }
  section + section { border-top: 1px solid var(--line); }

  /* Section headers — larger, with kicker + icon */
  .head { display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 14px; margin: 0 0 32px; }
  .head .ico {
    flex: none; width: 40px; height: 40px; border-radius: 10px;
    display: grid; place-items: center;
    background: linear-gradient(135deg, #eff6ff, #fef2f2);
    color: var(--blue);
  }
  .head .ico svg { width: 22px; height: 22px; }
  .kicker {
    display: block; font-size: 12px; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: 0.09em;
    text-transform: uppercase; color: var(--red); margin-bottom: 2px;
  }
  .head h2 { font-size: 32px; margin: 0; font-weight: 800; letter-spacing: -0.02em; line-height: 1.15; }

  /* Hero */
  .hero-wrap { border-bottom: 1px solid var(--line); overflow: hidden; position: relative; }
  .hero {
    max-width: var(--maxw); margin: 0 auto; padding: 96px 24px 84px;
    position: relative; z-index: 1;
  }
  .hero-art {
    position: absolute; top: 0; right: 0; height: 100%; width: 46%;
    opacity: 0.9; pointer-events: none; z-index: 0;
    -webkit-mask-image: linear-gradient(90deg, transparent, #000 40%);
            mask-image: linear-gradient(90deg, transparent, #000 40%);
  }
  .hero-art svg { height: 100%; width: 100%; }
  .eyebrow {
    display: inline-block; font-size: 13px; font-weight: 600;
    color: var(--red); letter-spacing: 0.06em; text-transform: uppercase;
    margin-bottom: 18px;
  }
  .hero h1 { font-size: 56px; margin: 0 0 22px; font-weight: 800; letter-spacing: -0.03em; line-height: 1.05; max-width: 620px; }
  .hero p.lede { font-size: 21px; color: var(--muted); max-width: 560px; margin: 0; }
  .accent-bar {
    width: 72px; height: 5px; margin-top: 30px;
    background: linear-gradient(90deg, var(--blue), var(--red));
    border-radius: 3px;
  }

  /* Prose */
  .prose { max-width: 680px; }
  .prose p { margin: 0 0 18px; }
  .prose p:last-child { margin-bottom: 0; }

  /* Goals */
  .goals { list-style: none; padding: 0; margin: 0; display: grid; gap: 4px; }
  .goals li {
    padding: 18px 0; border-bottom: 1px solid var(--line);
    display: flex; gap: 18px; align-items: baseline;
  }
  .goals li:last-child { border-bottom: none; }
  .goals .num {
    color: var(--blue); font-weight: 800; font-size: 20px; font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums;
    min-width: 30px;
  }

  /* Schedule table */
  .table-wrap { overflow-x: auto; -webkit-overflow-scrolling: touch; }
  table { width: 100%; border-collapse: collapse; font-size: 15px; min-width: 560px; }
  thead th {
    text-align: left; font-size: 12px; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.06em;
    color: var(--muted); font-weight: 600; padding: 0 16px 12px 0; border-bottom: 2px solid var(--ink);
  }
  tbody td { padding: 16px 16px 16px 0; border-bottom: 1px solid var(--line); vertical-align: top; }
  tbody tr:hover { background: var(--bg-soft); }
  td.topic { font-weight: 600; }
  td.date { white-space: nowrap; color: var(--muted); font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums; }
  .tag {
    display: inline-block; font-size: 12px; font-weight: 600; padding: 2px 8px;
    border-radius: 999px; margin: 2px 4px 2px 0; white-space: nowrap;
  }
  .tag.disc { background: #eff6ff; color: var(--blue-dark); }
  .tag.assign { background: #fef2f2; color: var(--red); }
  .tag.extra { background: #f4f4f5; color: var(--muted); }
  .star { color: var(--red); font-weight: 700; }
  .break-row td {
    text-align: center; font-style: italic; color: var(--muted);
    background: var(--bg-soft); font-size: 14px;
  }
  .note {
    font-size: 14px; color: var(--muted); margin-top: 18px;
    display: flex; gap: 8px; align-items: baseline;
  }

  /* Assignments */
  .cards { display: grid; gap: 16px; grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr); }
  .card {
    border: 1px solid var(--line); border-radius: 12px; padding: 22px;
    border-top: 3px solid var(--red);
  }
  .card h3 { margin: 0 0 6px; font-size: 18px; }
  .card .due { font-size: 13px; color: var(--muted); font-weight: 600; }
  .card p { margin: 10px 0 0; font-size: 14px; color: var(--muted); }

  /* Info / contact */
  .info-grid { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr; gap: 32px; }
  .info-grid dt { font-size: 12px; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.06em; color: var(--muted); }
  .info-grid dd { margin: 4px 0 20px; }

  footer {
    max-width: var(--maxw); margin: 0 auto; padding: 40px 24px 64px;
    border-top: 1px solid var(--line); color: var(--muted); font-size: 14px;
  }

  @media (max-width: 720px) {
    .hero h1 { font-size: 40px; }
    .hero p.lede { font-size: 18px; }
    .hero-art { display: none; }
    .head h2 { font-size: 26px; }
    section { padding: 56px 20px; }
    .cards { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
    .info-grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr; gap: 0; }
    .nav-links { display: none; }
  }
</style>
</head>
<body>

<nav>
  <div class="nav-inner">
    <div class="brand"><span class="code">LT 2010</span> · Computer Skills for the Information Age</div>
    <div class="nav-links">
      <a href="#overview">Overview</a>
      <a href="#goals">Goals</a>
      <a href="#schedule">Schedule</a>
      <a href="#assignments">Assignments</a>
      <a href="#info">Info</a>
    </div>
  </div>
</nav>

<div class="hero-wrap">
  <!-- Hero imagery: abstract network of nodes (blue/red) -->
  <div class="hero-art" aria-hidden="true">
    <svg viewBox="0 0 400 500" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg">
      <g stroke="#1d4ed8" stroke-width="1.2" opacity="0.5">
        <line x1="120" y1="90"  x2="250" y2="140"/>
        <line x1="250" y1="140" x2="340" y2="90"/>
        <line x1="250" y1="140" x2="300" y2="250"/>
        <line x1="120" y1="90"  x2="150" y2="220"/>
        <line x1="150" y1="220" x2="300" y2="250"/>
        <line x1="150" y1="220" x2="220" y2="330"/>
        <line x1="300" y1="250" x2="360" y2="360"/>
        <line x1="220" y1="330" x2="360" y2="360"/>
        <line x1="220" y1="330" x2="270" y2="430"/>
        <line x1="360" y1="360" x2="270" y2="430"/>
      </g>
      <g>
        <circle cx="120" cy="90"  r="6" fill="#1d4ed8"/>
        <circle cx="250" cy="140" r="9" fill="#dc2626"/>
        <circle cx="340" cy="90"  r="5" fill="#1d4ed8"/>
        <circle cx="150" cy="220" r="7" fill="#1d4ed8"/>
        <circle cx="300" cy="250" r="10" fill="#dc2626"/>
        <circle cx="220" cy="330" r="6" fill="#1d4ed8"/>
        <circle cx="360" cy="360" r="7" fill="#1d4ed8"/>
        <circle cx="270" cy="430" r="8" fill="#dc2626"/>
      </g>
    </svg>
  </div>
